The producer-source gate is healthy so far: both mounted producer files match the hashes in the source manifest and generator manifest, and the image key embedded in the launcher path matches the immutable generator image ID. I’m now recording that check together with a fresh trusted-code reconstruction of all 29 local verification-module rules and a strict ordered/bijective comparison to Stage 3.
